images/left_menu/k_uoam.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"5\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/k_line.gif\" width=\"110\"></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_mw/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">매직무기</font></a> / <a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_mw_1/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">특수무기</font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p><table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"80%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"top\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>특수 \n                            무기</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"comment\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> <b>Ancient Wyrms</b>, <b>Balrons</b>, <b>Blood Elementals</b>, <b>Bone \n      Knights</b>, <b>Daemons</b>, </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Dragons</b>, <b>Liches</b>, <b>Lich Lords</b>, \n      <b>Ogre Lords</b>, <b>Ophidian Matriarchs</b>, </font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Shadow Wyrms</b>, <b>Terathan \n      Avengers</b>, <b>Terathan Matriarchs</b>, </font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Ore Elementals \n                            </b>의 몬스터에게서 \n                            주로 얻을수있다. </font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">\n<font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p><table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"80%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"top\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>일반적인몬스터 \n                            계열</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"80%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"silver\" class=\"heading\" height=\"20\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>접미사</b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"silver\" class=\"heading\" height=\"20\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>추가데미지</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Slaying</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">+7</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Slaughter</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">더블</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Thrashing</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">+10</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Bashing</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">+5</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"height=&quot;14&quot;\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Slashing</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"14\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">?</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Smashing</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">?</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">\n<font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p><table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"80%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"top\" colspan=\"2\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>엘리멘탈 \n                            계열</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" class=\"comment\" colspan=\"2\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">*아래에 \n                            있는 것들은 엘리멘탈계열에 효과가 있다</font>\n</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"silver\" class=\"heading\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>접두사</b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"silver\" class=\"heading\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>효과</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Vaccum</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Added damage to </font><font color=\"#3366FF\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Air Elementals</b></font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(에어 \n                            엘리멘탈 추가데미지)</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Wind</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Added damage to Air Elementals</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"silver\" class=\"heading\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>접미사</b></font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"silver\" class=\"heading\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>효과</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Blood Draining</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Added damage to </font><font color=\"#FF3366\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Blood Elementals</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(블러드엘리멘탈 \n                            추가데미지)</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Blood Drinking</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Added damage to Blood Elementals (unconfirmed)</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Blood Sucking</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Added damage to Blood Elementals (unconfirmed)</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Blood Stealing</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Added damage to Blood Elementals (unconfirmed)</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Earth Crushing</font></p></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Added damage to </font><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Earth Elementals</b></font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(어스 \n                            엘리멘탈 추가데미지)</fon